/ref 17592186409641 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409648 1075 #edb/ref 17592186409642 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409648 1075 #edb/ref 17592186409647 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409648 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409648 1077 "selection" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409648 1078 #edb/ref 17592186409642 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409648 1079 #uuid "504a276b-9fed-5959-a86c-c2b987992901" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409649 1075 #edb/ref 17592186409640 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409649 1075 #edb/ref 17592186409643 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409649 1075 #edb/ref 17592186409644 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409649 1075 #edb/ref 17592186409645 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409649 1075 #edb/ref 17592186409646 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409649 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409649 1077 "selection" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409649 1078 #edb/ref 17592186409646 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409649 1079 #uuid "c178518b-a0fe-5bb1-9ccb-2e562d423be4" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409650 1068 #edb/ref 17592186409649 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409650 1069 "q-36523" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409650 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409650 1071 "Consider that the function $f(x,y)$ and all of its first, second and third-order partial derivatives are continuous on an open set $U.$ What is the value of ${f}_{yxy}(1,0)-{f}_{yy}(1,0)-{f}_{xyy}(1,0)$ given that ${f}_{yy}(x,y)={x}^{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡xy?$" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409650 1072 #uuid "08ef8961-263a-5251-a28f-91bd26031d10" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409650 1074 "As the function and its first, second, and third-order partial derivatives are continuous on an open set $U,$ we must have ${f}_{yxy}(x,y)={f}_{xyy}(x,y).$ \n\nTherefore, we can swap the order of the subscripts in the first term. This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{yxy}(1,0)-{f}_{yy}(1,0)-{f}_{xyy}(1,0) & ={f}_{xyy}(1,0)-{f}_{yy}(1,0)-{f}_{xyy}(1,0) \\\\  & =\\cancel{{f}_{xyy}(1,0)}-{f}_{yy}(1,0)-\\cancel{{f}_{xyy}(1,0)} \\\\  & =-{f}_{yy}(1,0) \\\\  & =-(1)^{3}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(1\\cdot 0) \\\\  & =-1\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡0 \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409651 1068 #edb/ref 17592186409648 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409651 1069 "q-133393" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409651 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409651 1071 "Evaluate ${f}_{zxz}(2,\\frac{1}{2},1)$ given that a function $f(x,y,z)$ and all of its higher-order partial derivatives are continuous on an open set $U,$ and that\n\n$$\n{f}_{zz}(x,y,z)=2z\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-2y)+x{e}^{z-2y}\n$$" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409651 1072 #uuid "923e8280-3481-5e90-8081-225a78ef2cea" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409651 1074 "As the higher-order partial derivatives are continuous on an open set $U,$ the mixed partial derivatives must be equal. \n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{zzx}(x,y,z) & ={f}_{zxz}(x,y,z) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({f}_{zz}(x,y,z)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(2z\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-2y)+x{e}^{z-2y}) \\\\  & =2z\\cdot \\frac{1}{x-2y}+{e}^{z-2y} \\\\  & =\\frac{2z}{x-2y}+{e}^{z-2y}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we evaluate the partial derivative at the point  $(2,\\frac{1}{2},1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{zxz}(2,\\frac{1}{2},1) & =\\frac{2\\cdot 1}{2-2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}}+{e}^{1-2\\cdot 1/2} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{2-1}+{e}^{1-1} \\\\  & =2+1 \\\\  & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409652 1062 #uuid "035a465c-a1c6-5467-ae17-a4aa635d3e19" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409652 1063 #edb/ref 17592186409651 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409653 1058 #edb/ref 17592186409652 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409653 1062 #uuid "55584015-c136-5819-9111-6b2b98328a75" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409653 1063 #edb/ref 17592186348445 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409654 1058 #edb/ref 17592186409655 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409654 1062 #uuid "87e1e468-067a-5b37-817d-ee60c3d401bf" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409654 1063 #edb/ref 17592186124998 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409655 1058 #edb/ref 17592186409656 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409655 1062 #uuid "95f751f2-5411-50b2-8387-307a1ef77bce" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409655 1063 #edb/ref 17592186409650 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409656 1058 #edb/ref 17592186409653 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409656 1062 #uuid "dd83cd33-8573-5ef5-a0d5-36235eb60d0a" 13194139533578 17592186045417 true] [17592186409656 1063 #edb/ref 17592186394023 13194139533578 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-3c715a18-b04f-5fa8-b565-cd1d87a53bb9" 17592186409637 "answer-4421a8c6-aea6-5d62-9cd0-8a06f8915dcd" 17592186409638 "answer-45730328-f0dc-5c33-a6c2-53d71d04445d" 17592186409639 "answer-4a2bcb36-868f-5f54-a6d3-5044da4b78ba" 17592186409640 "answer-4d58c242-f6fd-5d67-8e96-0273fcae35a5" 17592186409641 "answer-59fd5070-c975-5965-b9d4-d62ba5834853" 17592186409642 "answer-5c1bdf62-5e9d-55fa-82ff-dab50af9bc96" 17592186409643 "answer-70500de8-c6d4-538a-a490-a042ef069ca3" 17592186409644 "answer-92afcd1e-56b0-514b-aa96-d6441ab63941" 17592186409645 "answer-b6d893f9-d5e3-5e3f-8ad1-b21394af5064" 17592186409646 "answer-d26ca855-4a28-50fd-bba1-040fec87c89e" 17592186409647 "answer-field-504a276b-9fed-5959-a86c-c2b987992901" 17592186409648 "answer-field-c178518b-a0fe-5bb1-9ccb-2e562d423be4" 17592186409649 "